{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About This Game</strong><br>The world\u2019s yarn reserves are running out\u2026 and only the bravest cats dare to fight for them!<br>In <i>Purrfekt Tanks</i> you command a cardboard battle-tank mounted on a trusty robot vacuum. Customize your feline crew, collect ridiculous weapons, and roll into chaotic battles for the softest treasure of all \u2013 yarn balls! \ud83e\uddf6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc31 <strong>Adorable chaos</strong> \u2013 pilot a cardboard tank with a cat commander on top.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Cardboard carnage</strong> \u2013 fragile armor, big explosions, and even bigger laughs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf6 <strong>Resource war</strong> \u2013 gather yarn balls before your rivals do.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Wacky arsenal</strong> \u2013 from catnip bombs to laser pointers, every weapon is silly but deadly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd16 <strong>Roomba power</strong> \u2013 forget treads, roll into combat on your faithful vacuum.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Boss battles</strong> \u2013 face gigantic multi-barrel cardboard fortresses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude39 <strong>Indie charm</strong> \u2013 fun, quirky, and absolutely full of cats.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a casual player looking for laughs or a cat-lover who\u2019s always dreamed of commanding a tank, <i>Purrfekt Tanks</i> delivers a purr-fect mix of cuteness and mayhem.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4016990?t=1763303062","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016990/213612005e93e2eb42f83a49622c59efaee5a732/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=176330306